WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.834
&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:00.959 --> 00:00:01.292
&lt;i&gt;[music swells]&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.293
Oh, no. Get down.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.461
[crash]

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:04.879
[crash]

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:07.674
&lt;i&gt;[Tracksuit mafia cheering]&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.801
We've got little
surprise for you, bro.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:11.094
Show yourself!

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:12.303
&lt;i&gt;Come on, throw it.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:13.763
Ahh!

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.182
[window breaks]

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:19.602
[crash]

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:21.146
Move, move!
Put them out!

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.024
[bottle breaks]

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.191
&lt;i&gt;What are you doing?&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:26.860
Put him out. 
He's on fire!

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:28.945
Told ya.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:29.988
Yeah.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:34.576
&lt;i&gt;[tense music swells]&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.577
I gotta get that suit.

00:00:39.664 --> 00:00:40.165
[clang]

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:45.170
Ahh!

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.171
&lt;i&gt;[crash]&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.131
Come on!

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:49.466
That's all you've got!

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:51.551
Come on, throw another one!

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:05.899
&nbsp;

